00:26:13.800 --> 00:26:21.100
Mr. Phatsa, moving things around
brings more energy to life.

00:26:21.100 --> 00:26:26.650
It feels like a change of place,
like a new environment.

00:26:30.600 --> 00:26:31.400
Huh?

00:26:32.560 --> 00:26:34.160
