00:26:42.960 --> 00:26:44.960
Mr. Nakhun will be worried to death.

00:26:45.170 --> 00:26:47.520
He's been busy with
the Rangsit project lately

00:26:47.520 --> 00:26:49.180
and hasn't been home for days.

00:26:49.460 --> 00:26:52.050
It'll be a real problem if both of them
fall sick.

00:26:52.050 --> 00:26:55.250
