00:27:34.540 --> 00:27:35.330
What's wrong?

00:27:35.330 --> 00:27:38.540
Phatsa gets tired so easily lately.

00:27:38.540 --> 00:27:41.110
He gets nauseous when he
eats something weird.

00:27:41.110 --> 00:27:45.220
There are only a few reasons
for these symptoms.

00:27:45.600 --> 00:27:46.900
Is Phatsa pregnant?

00:27:47.590 --> 00:27:49.790
I think so. Probably.

00:27:53.060 --> 00:27:54.190
Where are you going?

00:27:54.660 --> 00:27:55.900
To see Phatsa!

00:28:07.170 --> 00:28:08.350
What are you doing?

00:28:11.200 --> 00:28:12.390
What's wrong?

00:28:26.950 --> 00:28:27.750
Hm!

00:28:29.530 --> 00:28:30.530
What's wrong?

00:28:42.070 --> 00:28:43.410
What are you doing?

00:28:55.800 --> 00:28:57.320
Get some rest these days.

00:29:06.430 --> 00:29:08.090
You should go to bed early too.

00:29:10.660 --> 00:29:12.060
I don't want to sleep yet.

00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:14.900
I'm happy.

00:29:17.950 --> 00:29:18.900
Why?

00:29:20.320 --> 00:29:21.720
Is the project finished?

00:30:08.820 --> 00:30:09.880
What are you doing?

00:30:13.110 --> 00:30:14.080
