00:30:46.100 --> 00:30:47.530
It's good for you.

00:30:49.350 --> 00:30:50.150
OK?

00:30:51.450 --> 00:30:53.400
I'll really get bloated if I drink more.

00:30:53.400 --> 00:30:54.690
Then take your time.

00:30:57.230 --> 00:30:58.630
But you have to finish it.

