00:41:29.700 --> 00:41:31.930
Buy records from the hospital.

00:41:32.280 --> 00:41:33.810
Whatever the cost,

00:41:34.530 --> 00:41:36.830
I need to know who that child is.

00:41:38.400 --> 00:41:40.400
