00:41:40.940 --> 00:41:44.640
Our people are tracing through
the visitation records.

00:41:49.230 --> 00:41:51.630
I want that Pure Omega

00:41:52.930 --> 00:41:54.400
to be paired with Nakhin.

00:41:55.760 --> 00:41:57.560
No one else must get there first.

00:41:59.560 --> 00:42:02.020
I'll have this arranged
as soon as possible.

